:: CollapseTick [header]
<!-- While the cellar collapses, every passage visit costs one move and undo is disabled. -->\
<!-- noTick passages are free, and so is the visit right after one (the Inventory's Return link). -->\
(if: (passage:)'s tags contains "noTick")[]\
(else-if: $free_return)[(set: $free_return to false)]\
<!-- The Buried check lives inside the tick branch: Buried is noTick, so it can't redirect to itself in a loop. -->\
(else-if: $collapsing)[(set: $moves_left to it - 1)(if: $moves_left < 0)[(goto: "Buried")]]\
<!-- No undoing out of the collapse. The sidebar is drawn before this header runs, so hide its now-dead undo icon. -->\
(if: $collapsing)[(forget-undos: -1)(replace: ?sidebar)[]]\
(if: $collapsing and not ((passage:)'s tags contains "noTick"))[(display: "CollapseStatus")]


:: CollapseStatus
<!-- A sizing line (must contain "=") starting at the left edge makes the meter fill from the left; a centred one fills from the middle. -->\
(meter: bind $moves_left, $collapse_budget, "XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX=", "Moves left: " + (str: $moves_left), #8b1a1a)
(if: $moves_left >= 8)[''Dust trickles from the ceiling. The cellar is starting to give way.'']\
(else-if: $moves_left >= 5)[''Beams groan overhead, and cracks race across the stone.'']\
(else-if: $moves_left >= 2)[''Chunks of rock crash down around you. Hurry!'']\
(else-if: $moves_left is 1)[''The ceiling sags above you. You don't have long.'']\
(else:)[''The roof is coming down! Get out now, or you're buried.'']
---


:: Buried [noTick noInvDisplay noInvLink]
<script>pushEvent('Story', 'Finish', 'Buried')</script>\
With a final, deafening *crack*, the ceiling gives way. Stone and earth pour down around you, and the Heartstone's red glow fades beneath the rubble.

The Dark Cellar has claimed you.

(link: "Try again")[(restart:)]
